Nos Mortem is a Victorian-style manor in a fane deep below [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. It's owned by [[Benjamin Grayson]], and staffed with a whole host of skeletons, ghosts, and ghouls.

The fane around it is a grassy plain under an artificial storm, red lightning moving through the clouds. A river runs out of the dark past the manor's back porch, which becomes a dock. The house is two stories of wood, its windows curtained and lit from within.

Its staff include the skeleton majordomo [[Ossain Madrun]], the ghost butler [[Salo Murn]], the ghoul footman [[Syrin]], ghost maids who dust the foyer, and ghostly chefs. Guests are given the run of the manor, except for a locked door to the basement in the Western Hall. An enclosed greenhouse runs along the back of the house, holding fruit trees with pale, barkless trunks and heavy deep red fruit.

Behind a hinged painting of Grayson in the master bedroom is a two-story private study. On its lower floor a runic circle is gouged into the boards and filled with dried blood, and within it lies the upper half of [[Mr. Whiskers]].
